Create an attractive promotional social media post for an
AI Workshop.

Include the workshop title, benefits, invitation,
registration call-to-action and relevant hashtags.
Use an engaging tone.
""",

    "One-shot": """
Example:
Join our Python Workshop!
Learn Python programming through practical sessions.
Register today and improve your coding skills!
#Python #Workshop #Learning

Now create a similar promotional post for an AI Workshop.
""",

    "Few-shot": """
Example 1:
Join our Web Development Workshop!
Build websites and learn modern technologies.
Register now!
#WebDevelopment #Workshop

Example 2:
Join our Data Science Workshop!
Explore data analysis and machine learning.
Don't miss this opportunity!
#DataScience #Learning

Now create an engaging promotional social media post
for an AI Workshop.

Include benefits, registration details and hashtags.
"""
